;; Refresh only while a PesoWise report list is open. The list form handles Esc
;; to stop the timer and return to Gateway; entering any PesoWise list starts it.
[System : Event]
PW Auto Refresh Event : TIMER : TRUE : Refresh Data

[Function : PWStopAutoRefreshAndExit]
00 : STOP TIMER : PW Auto Refresh Event
10 : FORM DISPLAY REJECT

[Key : PW Stop Auto Refresh]
Key : Esc
Action : Call : PWStopAutoRefreshAndExit
Title : "Exit PesoWise Report"

[#Report : PW Claim Verification List]
On : Load : Yes : Start Timer : PW Auto Refresh Event : 10
[#Report : PW Claim Approval List]
On : Load : Yes : Start Timer : PW Auto Refresh Event : 10
[#Report : PW Detailed Expense List]
On : Load : Yes : Start Timer : PW Auto Refresh Event : 10
[#Report : PW Daily Project List]
On : Load : Yes : Start Timer : PW Auto Refresh Event : 10

[#Form : PW CV List Form]
Add : Keys : PW Stop Auto Refresh
[#Form : PW CA List Form]
Add : Keys : PW Stop Auto Refresh
[#Form : PW DE List Form]
Add : Keys : PW Stop Auto Refresh
[#Form : PW DPR List Form]
Add : Keys : PW Stop Auto Refresh
